meta {
  name: List TACOTS tracking records
  type: http
  seq: 18
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/tacots/tracking?page=&limit=&orderBy=&search=&sortBy=
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 
  limit: 
  orderBy: 
  search: 
  sortBy: 
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List TACOTS Tracking Records
  
  Returns a paginated list of TACOTS beneficiary tracking records, ordered by creation date. Supports full-text search via PostgreSQL GIN index.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default     | Description / Allowed Values                                                                                          |
  |-----------|--------|----------|-------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | page      | number | No       | `1`         | Page number (integer >= 1)                                                                                            |
  | limit     | number | No       | `25`        | Items per page (integer, 1-100)                                                                                       |
  | orderBy   | string | No       | `desc`      | Sort direction. One of: `asc`, `desc`                                                                                 |
  | sortBy    | string | No       | `createdAt` | One of: `academicSession`, `academicTerm`, `region`, `studentAveragePct`, `assessmentPeriod`, `createdAt`              |
  | search    | string | No       | —           | Full-text search query. When provided, cache and sort filters are bypassed and results are matched against the GIN index. |
  
  ### Searchable Fields
  
  | Field              | Weight | Notes                                          |
  |--------------------|--------|-------------------------------------------------|
  | `academicTerm`     | A      | Combined with `firstName` + `surname` from the joined TACOTS recommendation record |
  | `firstName`        | A      | From the joined TACOTS recommendation record    |
  | `surname`          | A      | From the joined TACOTS recommendation record    |
  | `assessmentPeriod` | A      |                                                 |
  | `region`           | B      |                                                 |
  | `mentorName`       | B      |                                                 |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated array of TACOTS tracking records. Each item includes `firstName`, `surname`, and `schoolName` joined from the TACOTS recommendation record via the onboarding link.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "All Tacots tracking data found successfully",
    "data": [
      {
        "firstName": "string",
        "surname": "string",
        "id": "uuid",
        "studentId": "uuid",
        "schoolId": "uuid",
        "schoolName": "string",
        "region": "string",
        "academicSession": "2025/26",
        "academicTerm": "string",
        "assessmentPeriod": "string",
        "submissionDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
        "highestSubjectScore": "string",
        "lowestSubjectScore": "string",
        "studentAveragePct": 78.5,
        "studentPositionInClass": "string",
        "academicComment": "string" | null,
        "socialBehaviorRating": 4,
        "schoolRulesRating": 3,
        "responsibilityRating": 5,
        "formationComments": "string" | null,
        "mentorName": "string",
        "mentorshipSessionDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
        "mentorshipMode": "string",
        "mentorshipDuration": "string",
        "mentorshipNotes": "string",
        "serviceActivityType": "string",
        "serviceDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
        "serviceDuration": "string",
        "serviceDescription": "string",
        "serviceSupervisor": "string",
        "tuitionFeePaid": 50000,
        "resourcesSpent": 15000,
        "sundriesSpent": 5000,
        "totalAmountSpent": 70000,
        "financialNotes": "string" | null,
        "termResultUrl": "string",
        "termResultPublicId": "string",
        "paymentEvidenceUrl": "string" | null,
        "paymentEvidencePublicId": "string" | null
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 25,
        "totalPages": 1
      },
      "metadata": {
        "totalRecords": 120,
        "highRiskStudents": 5,
        "onboardingRate": 75.5,
        "completed": 10
      },
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                         |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters (e.g. non-numeric `page`). |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.            |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `read` permission.               |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                            |
}
